Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Gerald KERMA <devel@cybermind.fr>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: secubox-dns
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0.0)
Description: SecuBox DNS — authoritative BIND zone manager
 BIND zone management dashboard for SecuBox: create, edit, and serve
 authoritative DNS records you own.
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the DNS cluster:
  - secubox-dns-provider — external registrar API (OVH, Cloudflare,
    Gandi, Route53). Install if you publish records *at a registrar*.
  - secubox-vortex-dns — recursive DNS firewall with RPZ + threat
    feeds (unbound-backed).
  - secubox-dns-guard — DNS anomaly detection (dnsmasq-backed).
  - secubox-ad-guard — ad/tracker DNS blocking with per-device stats.
